{
    "Events": {
        "list": [
            {
                "_comment": "Kanon_Dialogue. OnDialogue entry (trigger None until OnDialogue trigger type is implemented in engine). Fires when player talks to Kanon. First-branch dispatches 4 cases: (1) offer==1 && !firstvisit_done && in office -> first-visit narrative; (2) in office (else) -> greeting + debt progress; (3) offer==1 && !firstvisit_done && not in office -> 'come to my office'; (4) not in office (else) -> defer to greeting kojo (placeholder). OnDialogue_Options events are displayed by the engine AFTER this event finishes. DESIGN NOTES: Kanon does NOT know about any promise regarding Kanade -> kanade handling is presence-only, never asks 'where is your sister'. Punishment/victim commentary branches on erav_last_victim (Kanon took part in the punishment event, and may herself be the victim when value==4); on-time payment clears it to 0. TODO: placeholder conditions need real engine support — isActiveFaction (plan §15 Q3), notHasKojoVariable / kojoVariable value & day arithmetic (§15 Q2/Q4), targetExists for kanade-in-room, greeting kojo collection function for branch 4 (§15 Q2).",
